[en.IDEA_C15_TRIBUTED_LOVE]
Tributed Love

[en.IDEA_C15_TRIBUTED_LOVE_desc]
The Canterlot Pact stipulates that the Crystal Empire is obliged to ensure that the food of the Changelings is sufficient, so the Crystal Empire should regularly transport its love to the Changeling Empire. At the same time, the Crystal Empire needs to provide military and other aspects of cooperation to facilitate the Changeling Empire to check the execution of the relevant terms.

[zh.IDEA_C15_TRIBUTED_LOVE]
爱意贡赋

[zh.IDEA_C15_TRIBUTED_LOVE_desc]
《坎特洛特协定》明确规定，水晶帝国有义务保证幻形灵的食物充足，因此水晶帝国应定期将其产出的爱意运输至幻形灵帝国。同时，水晶帝国需要提供军事等方面的配合，以方便幻形灵帝国对相关条约执行情况的检查。
